# Fedora major version this host image tracks — the single place it's
# declared. Consumed by:
#   - build.sh            (local break-glass build: base tag + local tags)
#   - bees thinkpad-image-build.sh (base tag + immutable registry tags)
# The Containerfile takes it as a build-arg (its ARG default is only a
# fallback), and the REGISTRY ROLLING REF is version-neutral (:stable) so a
# Fedora bump never has to touch the boot reference or zot retention — the
# 2026-09-24 trap: retention patterns anchored to ^44$ would have GC'd every
# tag of version 45 within a day of a bump.
FEDORA_MAJOR_VERSION=44
